ng.  Please contact ofnie.education@mcgill.ca   with any questions you may have. Hiring Unit: Bureau de l’éducation des Premières Nations et des Inuit (OFNIE) Course Title: Médias, technologie et éducation Subject Code: EDEC 262 716 Location: Kuujjuaq Schedule: Du 24 au 27 novembre et du 1er au 4 décembre, de 9 h à 12 h et de 13 h 15 à 14 h 15; le 7 décembre, de 9 h à 12 h Deadline to Apply: 2026-10-19 McGill University hires on the basis of merit and is strongly committed to equity and diversity within its community. We welcome applications from racialized persons/visible minorities, women, Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, ethnic minorities, and persons of minority sexual orientations and gender identities, as well as from all qualified candidates with the skills and knowledge to productively engage with diverse communities. McGill implements an employment equity program and encourages members of designated groups to self-identify. Persons with disabilities who anticipate needing accommodations for any part of the application process may contact, in confidence, accessibilityrequest.hr@mcgill.ca ."
